rimary button-wrapper\" href=\"https://vigeoretreats.com/retreat/the-wholehearted-woman-retreat/\"><span>Join Erin at Angkor Wat</span></a></p><div><hr></div><h3><strong>Power &amp; Pause Retreat</strong></h3><p><strong>A high-touch program supported by structured processes, guided practices, and reflective assignments</strong></p><p>24 - 28 September 2026<br>Ubud, Bali<br><br>Led by Subba Sattvic and Erin Lee</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GMsm!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8238b0bd-1624-4cbd-8a34-fc44254ec8eb_1080x1080.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GMsm!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8238b0bd-1624-4cbd-8a34-fc44254ec8eb_1080x1080.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GMsm!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8238b0bd-1624-4cbd-8a34-fc44254ec8eb_1080x1080.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GMsm!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8238b0bd-1624-4cbd-8a34-fc44254ec8eb_1080x1080.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GMsm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8238b0bd-1624-4cbd-8a34-fc44254ec8eb_1080x1080.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GMsm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8238b0bd-1624-4cbd-8a